# xlang Docs Structure

| Doc | Owns |
|-----|------|
| `PACKAGE_MANAGER.md` | CLI names, flags, defaults |
| `PROJECT_CONFIG.md` | `xlang.conf`, packages/entries, prefer_source/static |
| `INSTALLING.md` | User/root registries, hash checks |
| `PUBLISHING.md` | Artifacts, git hash, immutability, PM server future note |
| `LINKING.md` | Link pipeline, search paths |
| `STATIC_LIBRARY.md` | Static artifact semantics |
| `LANGUAGE.md` | Language syntax/runtime |

On conflict: CLI surface → package manager doc; registry/hash → installing; publish permanence → publishing; link order → linking; project shape → project config.
